=== R4: Prop 10.1(a),(e),(f): Demski's process, the theory-drawing process, a single draw ===
Demski's process (draw a sentence; keep it iff consistent with what is kept) and the theory-drawing
process (draw a theory = output of a machine on random bits; keep it iff consistent) have the same
finite stand-in: a full-support draw law over the 16 propositions of 2 atoms (0 = inconsistent draw).
